    "attributes": {
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "\nIt is important to effectively communicate the problem in the motivation section in order to demonstrate the relevance and significance of the research to the reader. Altough you point out the problem within your exposé, it would benefit from a more detailed explanation. The individual aspects addressed should be supplemented with examples or detailed explanations. Ask yourself again: What is the consequence of this problem for the community? What is the current approach to the problem?"
