      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "The relevance of the state of the art should be clearly established, demonstrating how existing research ties into the current study and why it is crucial for advancing the research. This connection is not fully evident in your work. Take another look at your SOTA and think about why it is important. Additionally, address the weak points of your SOTA."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "It is also important to establish a good theoretical framework in order to develop a good methodology. Your exposé already shows good points for this, but could benefit from more explanation. For that, read through your theoretical framework again and try to structure it more logically."
